name: Erratic Three Spike — many 3s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Threes, a 25% rank spike for Hack,
  Fibonacci, Odd Todd, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic threes, many 3s,
  low-card pile, three-of-a-kind start, funny rank clump.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Three
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: Hack
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 50
  - joker: Fibonacci
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: OddTodd
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheTrio
    label: "Three of a Kind payoff from Three density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
